base.rea
-3                     spatial dimension  ( < 0 --> generate .rea/.re2 pair)
1                      number of fields
#=======================================================================
# EL stream at a held IBM sphere: inflow at x = 0, outflow at x = 2,
# periodic y and z; sphere d = 0.3 at (0.8, 0.5, 0.5)
#=======================================================================
Box
-16  -8  -8                                          nelx,nely,nelz
0 2 1.                                               x0,x1,ratio
0 1 1.                                               y0,y1,ratio
0 1 1.                                               z0,z1,ratio
v  ,O  ,P  ,P  ,P  ,P                                bc's  (3 chars each!)
